{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0483_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3fac757d18680af19f65dc15f59405b47e79e25d7e71d0348f5593ebe1425b9b", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影。\n……なのだが、なぜか美奈子にじっと見られている）", "zh": "（今天要拍写真杂志《偶像写真！！》。……不过，不知为什么，美奈子一直盯着我看。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0483_1001_p", "source_sha256": "88bbb563781a335e5ac23814dbf49d811889fd3c1ff111ca47bd7e6b14599541", "ja": "なあ、美奈子……。何か心配事でもあるのか？", "zh": "喂，美奈子……你是不是有什么担心的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0483_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "139749edb1411cd68abac96dcdf42bc74125cbc1297bd1da80c3b36a7cb9ed7d", "ja": "えっ！？　な、なんのことですか……？", "zh": "诶！？没、没什么事啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0483_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4a772ca6487c5cc261fde7162943c67e9a8abf9b19fd8cece6c9188de4e9d454", "ja": "あれ、違ったか？　ずっとこっちを見てるから\n言いたいことでもあるのかと思って……。", "zh": "咦，不对吗？因为你一直看着这边，我还以为你有什么想说的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0483_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "93463bf061cdf3522e1893f0177b8e83b0b3c6019e3a39d5321512c8f10ce38b", "ja": "う～ん……その、違わないんですが……\nええっと……。", "zh": "嗯……那个，并不是这样……\n呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0483_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "995a2d3f9eabd0c212c5669deadea98338de2305f6936c04f3643a87d5c5a1a0", "ja": "……わかりました！　{$P$}さん、\n最近しっかり休んでますか？", "zh": "……我知道了！{$P$}先生，\n您最近有好好休息吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0483_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "0af75f4da028b03d3e1fbc885390afa65b0329b35da9b7b4990c4250d4476b4d", "ja": "気のせいかな？　と思ったんですけど、\nいつもより元気がないような気がして……。", "zh": "是我的错觉吗？我觉得你似乎比平时没什么精神……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0483_1007_p", "source_sha256": "15f415711d02f03213af4b5dba9cef55959560a7e97acbbfe9b4450d7a39f8b6", "ja": "そうか……。忙しいけど、ちゃんと休む時間は\nとるようにしてるよ。心配してくれてありがとな。", "zh": "这样啊……虽然忙，但我还是会好好抽时间休息的。谢谢你担心我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0483_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "e5f7236b5ca050dfe7e91866a4910d3b7384871b59b88d5ebdda22e0443b4bbe", "ja": "よかった……。{$P$}さんの\n口から直接聞けて、安心しました。", "zh": "太好了……。能听{$P$}先生\n亲口这么说，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0483_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "504012229a9f8fd4abb4ac5bd2daa6056e947a691476ecc70c455fddeac0995b", "ja": "でも今は良くてもこれからは分かりませんし、\n栄養はたくさん摂ってくださいね！", "zh": "不过现在没事，也不代表以后就没问题，所以请一定要多摄取营养哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0483_1010_p", "source_sha256": "95544a3b01261a9cb16694eeb59028391e57e3c6be1c808b1ed55e2dc64aed2f", "ja": "ははっ、そうするよ。", "zh": "哈哈，会注意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0483_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "d1c27613f40cef3b802006b98ca7f2e807e6d4d6a440fb428d3c154312a45fca", "ja": "あと睡眠も大事ですよ。量もですけど、質も必要で……\n枕とか、寝る時の服装も重要なんですよ！", "zh": "而且睡眠也很重要哦。睡眠时间是一方面，质量也必不可少……\n枕头啊、睡觉时穿的衣服也都很重要的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0483_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e474dab6a4230a89c6c71f3391803042564e64c690da6879deee6bb0ec8fc94f", "ja": "着てる服か……。寝具は気にしてたけど、\n服までは気が回らなかったな……。", "zh": "穿的衣服啊……我倒是在意寝具，\n但还真没顾得上衣服……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0483_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "2e02b81d28dd3da1dffba468d5c20dd8937536204a1aa58e296d9382aaaea5f1", "ja": "それだったら、この衣装の生地とかとってもいいと\n思いますよ！　膝をお貸しするので、試してみますか？", "zh": "如果是那样的话，我觉得这套服装的布料之类的非常不错哦！我可以借给你膝盖，要不要试试看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0483_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0483_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "574f8f3a6619a759b3b50393ba5fc6970f561169fed5a490645cacceddb11716", "ja": "あ、でもここじゃゆっくり確かめられませんよね。\n……うん。控え室に行きましょうか！", "zh": "啊，不过在这里没法慢慢确认吧。\n……嗯。我们去休息室吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0483_1016_p", "source_sha256": "3a41509aa2017640be870b8f64700ecf7a4a3f8f3149ae94757e8749b39bf8f0", "ja": "いや、場所の問題じゃ……み、美奈子！　気持ちだけ\n受け取っておくよ。だから今は撮影のことを考えよう！", "zh": "不是，问题不在地点……美奈子！你的心意我就收下了。所以现在先考虑拍摄的事吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0483_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "c9194418eb87bb26f500963ebaea8682e79432647cf0c1650118fde74ab55153", "ja": "わっ、確かに！　もうすぐ本番だ！　……でも、\nいつかは{$P$}さんに……ふふっ♪", "zh": "哇，确实！马上就要正式开拍了！……不过，\n总有一天会让{$P$}先生……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
